Vita (--vita-fast-obstacle=off|on|verify): the path obstacle search of the town passers
(PathTrace_c::checkObstacle, NPC_PASSER / NPC_CD3) with the same result. The original walks every
process of every layer for each passer (fpcM_Search with s_sub), so 40 passers and 19 citizens walk
the whole process tree 59 times a tick to hand checkObstacleSub the few actors with one of nine
names. The fast path keeps those actors, in the walk's order, from one walk with the same test, and
reuses them while no node list anywhere changed: every change of a node link or list owner goes
through c_node.cpp / cLs_Init, which bump twv_cls_generation. checkObstacleSub still runs for the
same actors in the same order on live positions, and ALINK still asks dKy_darkworld_check() at that
moment. verify runs the original walk for the game, the fast path beside it, and a fresh walk
against the kept list, and counts differences. Off (0) unless the Vita entry selects it; the counts
go to platform/vita/runtime/fast_actors.cpp.

